# LLM Security Scanner - Frontend Environment Variables
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# In local development, you can leave this empty because Vite's dev server proxies
# /api requests directly to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
#
# When deploying the frontend to Vercel, set this to your deployed Render backend URL:
# Example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://llm-security-scanner-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=
